      "text": "\\(\\dfrac{53}{200}\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "E",
      "text": "\\(\\dfrac{8}{15}\\)"
    }
  ],
  "answer": {
    "letter": "c",
    "value": "4/15"
  },
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-8-1985-p10.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The midpoint of \\(\\dfrac15\\) and \\(\\dfrac13\\) is their average.\n\n\\[\\dfrac{\\frac15 + \\frac13}{2} = \\dfrac{\\frac{8}{15}}{2} = \\dfrac{4}{15}.\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is C .",
      "hints": [
        "The point halfway between two numbers is their average",
        "\\(\\dfrac15 + \\dfrac13 = \\dfrac{8}{15};\\) then divide by \\(2\\)"
      ],
